user.description:
Paste a **personal access token** (`ecapi_…`, valid about a year; recommended). How to create one: {readme_url}

Fallback: the session cookie `portal.jwtToken` from your browser's developer tools (Application → Cookies → portal.eg-austria.at) after logging in to the member portal. It is valid for about a month.

The token is stored in Home Assistant and never shown again. This integration only reads data.

